+## Account (QR login) check
+
+`e2e-account.mjs` checks restore → QR code → cancel against the real
+Bilibili QR endpoints without logging in. Launch with an isolated Keychain
+item so the real login is never touched:
+
+```sh
+open --env LIVEHIME_KEYCHAIN_SERVICE=local.livehime.macos.e2e-test build_macos/frontend/RelWithDebInfo/LiveHime.app
+node e2e-account.mjs <websocket password>
+```
